# Storyboard shot 10: the showcase board in the integrated 3D view.
# Run with --prelude board-3d.prelude (switches to 3D unrecorded) and a --settle long enough for
# the first model (about 1 s on an idle machine; minutes when the machine is saturated).
# Window points for a 1500 x 1235 pt window.
wait 0.5
mark in
caption "Same design, now in 3D" 2.8
move 746 697 0.8
drag 746 697 900 690 4.0 right   # slow orbit
wait 0.4
caption "Real copper. Real thickness." 3
move 735 700 0.6
scroll 0 4 30 2.4                # dolly in toward U1
zoom 1.5 745 700 4.5
wait 0.4
drag 760 720 620 735 3.5 right   # orbit back across the fillets and lands
wait 0.8
mark out
